  "context_markdown": "This register records known, intentional differences between the supplied printed source and this working edition. The listed choices are adopted for the present edition; they do not claim to recover the original transcriber's intentions.\n\nThe review covers all four movements and all 20 pages of the supplied Breitkopf & Härtel/Dover scan, with magnified checks of identified passages. It is a source comparison, not a new critical edition or a guarantee that every small mark has been independently verified. The printed source is not an autograph.\n\nEntries are in score order. Bar numbers follow the native edition and restart at each movement. Variation numbering in movement III remains continuous. Irregular pickups and alternative endings do not always advance the displayed number; such locations are described explicitly. Images sometimes show a representative opening of a longer passage.",
